# Virtual environment
venv/

# Layers. The API reads them from MAPS_ROOT (the Azure Files share in Azure), never
# from the image. They stay in Git (LFS) so a clone has working layers for local
# development, tests and `azure/deploy.sh seed`, but the image must not carry them
# (~511 MB). The whole folder goes, index and metadata included: an index without
# its rasters would start an API that fails on every analysis.
app/maps/
